      "parameters": {
        "content": "# cron and baserow and fetch tradegate stock page\n\n## Purpose and structure\nThis folder contains the **cron and baserow and fetch tradegate stock page** workflow. Its executable nodes use `baserow`, `cron`, `function`, `htmlExtract`, `httpRequest`, `manualTrigger`, `sendGrid`, `set`. The table and connection map below are derived from the JSON, not an inferred guarantee of behavior.\n\n## Setup\nImport inactive. Configure your own credentials and replace REPLACE_WITH_* values. Review external destinations and Code nodes before running.\n\n## Entry points\nOn clicking 'execute', Cron\n\n## Verification\nSanitized source candidate; not runtime-tested. This overview is generated from node metadata. Read the folder README for the connection map, credential types, and license.\n\n## Attribution\nhttps://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows/blob/94007c1445d9258a7da116646b79473e7c7c3282/workflows/Manual/0250_Manual_Baserow_Update_Webhook.json\nMIT; preserve source notices.",
